flowchart TD
    A[Memory-Mapped I/O] --> B["fd = open(file)"]
    B --> C["addr = mmap(NULL, size, PROT_READ|PROT_WRITE, MAP_SHARED, fd, 0)"]
    
    C --> D[Virtual Memory]
    D --> E[Page Fault on first access]
    E --> F[Kernel loads pages from disk]
    F --> G[Direct memory access]
    
    G --> H[Modify data in memory]
    H --> I[Kernel syncs dirty pages]
    I --> J["msync() - explicit sync"]
    I --> K["munmap() - cleanup"]
    
    L[Benefits] --> L1[No read/write syscalls]
    L --> L2[Kernel handles paging]
    L --> L3[Shared memory between processes]
    L --> L4[Efficient for large files]
    
    M[Use Cases] --> M1[Large file processing]
    M --> M2[Shared memory IPC]
    M --> M3[Database engines]
    M --> M4[Device driver communication]
    
    style G fill:#e8f5e8
    style L1 fill:#d4edda
